{
  "id": "s4-notice",
  "title": "不是討論",
  "lines": [
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "（內心）我的聲音沒有我預想的顫抖。這並不讓它比較勇敢。雨澄坐下，看著我，沒有看資料夾。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "direct" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "好。繼續。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "direct" }] },

    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "（內心）雨澄低頭看了一眼自己的 T 恤。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "euphemism" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "MAKE IT OBVIOUS。你說的是「影響」，文件寫的是「裁撤」。我們先選一個名詞。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "euphemism" }] },
    { "speaker": "zeng-yalin", "text": "文件上的名詞比較接近事實。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "euphemism" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "公司決定裁撤你目前的職位。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "euphemism" }] },

    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "這是績效改善計畫？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "不是，我只是想先把背景——", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": "zeng-yalin", "text": "我需要更正。這次決定不是績效處分，也沒有核准用個人表現作為理由。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "（內心）雨澄終於坐下，把原子筆從掛繩上取下，平放在桌上。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "那你剛才是在幫公司找理由，還是在幫自己找？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "（內心）我沒有一個能放進紀錄裡的答案。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice2", "operator": "eq", "value": "performance" }] },

    { "speaker": null, "text": "藍色資料夾特寫。雨水在玻璃上拉出一條長痕。" },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "失去主要客戶後，公司取消了你目前負責的產品線，也決定不把這個職位轉到其他團隊。文件上有預計日期、給付項目、保險與設備處理，以及提問窗口。" },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "「決定」。" },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "（內心）她重複那兩個字，像在檢查按鈕文字。" },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "所以你們不是來問我的。這不是討論，只是通知？" }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "answer-admit",
      "text": "「對，決定已經完成。我很抱歉你到現在才知道。」",
      "next": "s5-when-did-you-know",
      "effects": [
        { "variable": "choice3", "operation": "set", "value": "admit" },
        { "variable": "trust", "operation": "add", "value": 2 },
        { "variable": "boundary", "operation": "add", "value": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "answer-deflect",
      "text": "「大家都很不容易，我也不希望事情變成這樣。」",
      "next": "s5-when-did-you-know",
      "effects": [
        { "variable": "choice3", "operation": "set", "value": "deflect" },
        { "variable": "avoidance", "operation": "add", "value": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "answer-bargain",
      "text": "「如果今天配合完成流程，我也許還能替你爭取轉圜。」",
      "next": "s5-when-did-you-know",
      "effects": [
        { "variable": "choice3", "operation": "set", "value": "bargain" },
        { "variable": "trust", "operation": "add", "value": -1 },
        { "variable": "procedure", "operation": "add", "value": -1 },
        { "variable": "avoidance", "operation": "add", "value": 1 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
